      "lines": [
        "求带有两位小数的$\\arcsin$函数值，利用数值自变量的",
        "$\\sin$函数表最简单. 为了计算带有四位小数的$\\arcsin$函数",
        "值，要利用两个表：用度表示的角度的正弦表和把角度的度数",
        "换算成弧度的表. 这时利用了这样一个事实：即数$y$的正弦",
        "等于$y$弧度角的正弦."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了求出$\\arcsin x$，在$-90^\\circ\\leqslant\\alpha^\\circ\\leqslant90^\\circ$范围内求出角度",
        "$\\alpha^\\circ$，使得"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\sin\\alpha^\\circ=x$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把$\\alpha^\\circ$表示成弧度：　　$\\alpha^\\circ=y$弧度，",
        "得到"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\sin y=x$，",
        "$\\arcsin x=y$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 1 求$\\arcsin0.9063$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$0.9063\\approx\\sin65^\\circ$，",
        "$65^\\circ\\approx1.1345$弧度，",
        "$\\arcsin0.9063\\approx1.1345$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
